## On foot

@narrator: The Lantern Sea has frozen. The lanterns are stuck in the ice like coins in a cake.
@pim{emotion="happy"}: Candles! Get your candles! You can't hold a vigil without a candle, it's in the name!
@narrator: Out on the ice, a girl in a grey coat is lighting them one at a time. There are a great many of them.
@lumi{emotion="surprised"}: That's Nyx. She's been out here since the first wish sank.
@nyx{emotion="shy"}: Oh. Visitors. Mind the thin bits. I'm the thin bits' friend, so they tell me.
